#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: description
#, no-wrap
msgid "Learn how quantum computations can be protected against noise through quantum error correcting codes and fault tolerance."
msgstr "Pelajari bagaimana komputasi kuantum bisa dilindungi dari noise melalui kode koreksi error kuantum dan toleransi kesalahan."

