#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Welcome to *Foundations of Quantum Error Correction,* the fourth course in the *Understanding Quantum Information and Computation* series comprising the following courses:\n"
msgstr "Selamat datang di *Fondasi Koreksi Kesalahan Kuantum,* kursus keempat dalam seri *Memahami Informasi dan Komputasi Kuantum* yang terdiri dari kursus-kursus berikut:\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "[Basics of quantum information](/learning/courses/basics-of-quantum-information)\n"
msgstr "[Dasar-dasar informasi kuantum](/learning/courses/basics-of-quantum-information)\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "[Fundamentals of quantum algorithms](/learning/courses/fundamentals-of-quantum-algorithms)\n"
msgstr "[Fundamental algoritma kuantum](/learning/courses/fundamentals-of-quantum-algorithms)\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "[General formulation of quantum information](/learning/courses/general-formulation-of-quantum-information)\n"
msgstr "[Formulasi umum informasi kuantum](/learning/courses/general-formulation-of-quantum-information)\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Foundations of quantum error correction (this course)\n"
msgstr "Fondasi koreksi kesalahan kuantum (kursus ini)\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"This course is on quantum error correction, with a focus on foundational concepts. \n"
"It begins with an explanation of what quantum error correcting codes are and how they work. \n"
"It then moves on to the discretization of errors phenomenon, the stabilizer formalism for \n"
"describing quantum error correcting codes, Calderbank–Shor–Steane (CSS) codes, and several \n"
"key examples of quantum error correcting codes, including the toric code and surface codes. \n"
"The course also discusses fault-tolerant quantum computation, in which quantum computations \n"
"are performed on error-corrected quantum information.\n"
msgstr ""
"Kursus ini membahas koreksi kesalahan kuantum, dengan fokus pada konsep-konsep dasar.\n"
"Dimulai dengan penjelasan tentang apa itu kode koreksi kesalahan kuantum dan cara kerjanya.\n"
"Kemudian berlanjut ke fenomena diskretisasi kesalahan, formalisme stabilizer untuk\n"
"mendeskripsikan kode koreksi kesalahan kuantum, kode Calderbank–Shor–Steane (CSS), dan beberapa\n"
"contoh penting kode koreksi kesalahan kuantum, termasuk kode torik dan kode permukaan.\n"
"Kursus ini juga membahas komputasi kuantum toleran terhadap kesalahan, di mana komputasi kuantum\n"
"dilakukan pada informasi kuantum yang sudah dikoreksi kesalahannya.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"This course is intended for students, professionals, and hobbyists in fields such as computer science, physics, \n"
"engineering, and mathematics who are eager to gain knowledge on the theoretical foundations of quantum information \n"
"and computation.\n"
msgstr ""
"Kursus ini ditujukan untuk mahasiswa, profesional, dan penghobi di bidang seperti ilmu komputer, fisika,\n"
"teknik, dan matematika yang ingin memperoleh pengetahuan tentang fondasi teoretis informasi dan komputasi kuantum.\n"

